<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Recorded surfer and drone GPS</name><description>Logged points within the requested window. Green: accepted surfer packets; orange: other/rejected surfer packets; blue: drone-position snapshots. Red overrides either subject colour when retreat was active at any point in that reporting interval. Repeated snapshots are retained, not new independent GPS fixes. Click a point for timestamp, GPS age if logged, source and original record. Times are observation/receipt times. Ground-clamped display, not flight altitude. Short arrows show bearing from the previous logged coordinate of the same subject, not aircraft heading or an observed path. Arrow length is display-only. No arrow for unchanged positions or the first point. A gap label identifies intervals over 1.5s. No connecting tracks or saved targets used as GPS observations.</description><Style id="surfer"><IconStyle><color>ff00cc00</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.85</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff00cc00</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="surfer_arrow"><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff00cc00</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Folder><name>Surfer — accepted packets</name></Folder><Style id="surfer_other"><IconStyle><color>ff0088ff</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.85</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff0088ff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="surfer_other_arrow"><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff0088ff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Folder><name>Surfer — rejected or acceptance unknown</name></Folder><Style id="drone"><IconStyle><color>ffff8800</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.85</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ffff8800</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="drone_arrow"><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ffff8800</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Folder><name>Drone — recorded position snapshots</name></Folder><Style id="retreat"><IconStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.85</scale><color>ff0000ff</color></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="retreat_arrow"><IconStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale><color>ff0000ff</color></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Folder><name>Travel direction arrows (display only)</name></Folder></Document></kml>